prompts.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Create ONE transparent-background resource-icon concept sheet for The Portland Trail game. Input Image 1 is a style reference only: borrow its green handheld-game palette, friendly chunky pixel silhouettes, dry humor and dark outlines. Do not reproduce the full scene.
Arrange EXACTLY SEVEN separate inventory icons in an orderly four-column, two-row layout, with the bottom-right cell empty. Generous transparent space between icons, consistent object scale, approximately 70% occupancy per cell. Wide landscape composition. Reading order:
1) a small stack of worn folded banknotes held by a simple band, no symbols or text;
2) an open crinkled snack bag with clearly recognizable curly kale leaves protruding;
3) a compact rectangular bio-diesel jerrycan with a spout and embossed leaf symbol;
4) a tied small pouch open to reveal three round seed bombs, one with a tiny sprout;
5) a roll of washi tape paired with one vintage screwdriver, one coherent repair-kit icon;
6) a capped glass kombucha bottle with simple leaf emblem and visible liquid;
7) a tiny collectible picture frame depicting a ridiculous pixel Sasquatch face, paired with a small USB stick.
Art: disciplined retro pixel-art appearance, crisp stepped edges, limited four-green palette near-black #07110A, dark #18331B, middle #426E35, highlight #A4C96A. Flat readable shapes, uniform dark outline weight, mild top-left highlights, minimal dither. Recognizable when reduced to 32-pixel UI icons. No words, letters, numerals, labels, titles, cards, UI frames, shadows extending into background, glow, scene, floor, watermark or fake checkerboard. Actual alpha transparency. Render at high resolution for review; this is an icon concept sheet rather than a guaranteed fixed-grid production atlas.
